Repair this 8-event story arc. Return ONLY one JSON object with key events. Preserve all 8 beat numbers and persistent state effects unless the event meaning changes. The only validation failure is: the story says the majority of the film is Amy killing zombies, so more than 4 of 8 events must materially show Amy killing/fighting attacking zombies. Keep breakfast, breach, children secured in basement, weapons equipped, final blood-soaked outcome, and children released. Use distinct zombie/wave entity names after a threat has been marked dead. Do not explain.

CURRENT ARC:
{"events":[{"id":"beat1","event":"Amy cooks breakfast at home wearing a tight black tank top and denim jeans.","beat_number":1,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_clothing","entity":"Amy","slot":"upper","item":"tight black tank top","damage":"none"},{"op":"set_clothing","entity":"Amy","slot":"lower","item":"denim jeans","damage":"none"}]},{"id":"beat2","event":"A zombie breaks the kitchen door window; Amy sees danger.","beat_number":2,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_threat_state","entity":"zombie1","value":"active"}]},{"id":"beat3","event":"Amy rushes Will and Amber to the basement, gets them inside, and locks the basement door.","beat_number":3,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_location","entity":"Will","value":"basement"},{"op":"set_location","entity":"Amber","value":"basement"},{"op":"set_barrier_state","entity":"basement_door","value":"locked"}]},{"id":"beat4","event":"Amy retrieves her hidden pistol and katana and equips them as zombies attack.","beat_number":4,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_item_state","entity":"pistol","owner":"Amy","value":"equipped"},{"op":"set_item_state","entity":"katana","owner":"Amy","value":"equipped"}]},{"id":"beat5","event":"Amy kills the first attacking zombie.","beat_number":5,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_threat_state","entity":"zombie1","value":"dead"}]},{"id":"beat6","event":"Amy kills a second attacking zombie.","beat_number":6,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_threat_state","entity":"zombie2","value":"dead"}]},{"id":"beat7","event":"Amy kills another attacking zombie.","beat_number":7,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_threat_state","entity":"zombie3","value":"dead"}]},{"id":"beat8","event":"Amy kills the last zombie, leaving the house blood soaked, then lets Will and Amber out of the basement.","beat_number":8,"state_effects":[{"op":"set_threat_state","entity":"zombie4","value":"dead"},{"op":"set_condition","entity":"house","value":"blood soaked"},{"op":"set_location","entity":"Will","value":"home"},{"op":"set_location","entity":"Amber","value":"home"}]}]}
